Interoperability and attribution
--------------------------------

The original stasstepv/hermes-pwa implementation at
7dc780bf80eb957ad0c2826954b54adce7db7ad5 describes a clean-room approach.
This Hermes Remote Web derivative additionally incorporates MIT-licensed Hermes
Agent apps/shared source at e8c97320ac8691d4de92af49f98459f9ef9ddb08.
The derivative is therefore NOT a clean-room implementation. Original attribution
is retained. Copied files, original hashes and local changes are documented in
upstream.lock.json, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/REMOTE_CONTRACT.md.
No Hermes visual assets or unlicensed Desktop code are copied. The shipped icons
are new neutral geometric assets; fonts are supplied by the operating system.

